      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0681",
      "reading_order": 734,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 724.20873681,
        "r": 298.4390258789999,
        "b": 709.2828958877272
      },
      "content": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0682",
      "reading_order": 735,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 701.88,
        "r": 503.9470792091007,
        "b": 672.8875148800329
      },
      "content": " Note: Accuracy  testing  is  for  informational  purposes  only,  and  is  not  to  be  used as a re-release test. If there is any concern as to infuser accuracy, contact Hospira."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0683",
      "reading_order": 736,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.00026992800002,
        "t": 658.1915674759,
        "r": 455.9447114140002,
        "b": 649.0001945569854
      },
      "content": "CAUTION: Do not remove the protective cover from the 21-gauge needle."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0684",
      "reading_order": 737,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.00026992800002,
        "t": 633.7834673698,
        "r": 351.54787059799975,
        "b": 624.8880354878328
      },
      "content": "To perform the delivery accuracy test, proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0685",
      "reading_order": 738,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58078317910002,
        "t": 609.7837276736999,
        "r": 481.44203821370064,
        "b": 600.8882957917327
      },
      "content": "Open the cassette door and insert a primed cassette. Close the cassette door."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0686",
      "reading_order": 739,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58078317910002,
        "t": 590.3437801556998,
        "r": 368.8465155661001,
        "b": 581.4483482737327
      },
      "content": "A 'NEW PATIENT?' message may appear. Press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0687",
      "reading_order": 740,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58078317910002,
        "t": 574.9236926736999,
        "r": 504.0467789092011,
        "b": 543.1082857797328
      },
      "content": "Install an 18-gauge blunt cannula or a 21-gauge needle to the distal end of the tubing.  Verify  the  fluid  container  is  46  to  61  cm  above  the  pumping  chamber. Verify all lines are unclamped."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0688",
      "reading_order": 741,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.5807831791,
        "t": 536.5836301797,
        "r": 422.1471106807003,
        "b": 527.6881982977328
      },
      "content": "Place the distal output end of tubing into the graduated cylinder."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0689",
      "reading_order": 742,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.5807831791,
        "t": 521.1635426977,
        "r": 280.64963101509994,
        "b": 512.2681108157328
      },
      "content": "Press the [A] softkey to select line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0690",
      "reading_order": 743,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58078317909998,
        "t": 505.6836951557,
        "r": 333.81815639710015,
        "b": 496.78826327373275
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 200 mL/hr and VTBI of 10 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0691",
      "reading_order": 744,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58078317909998,
        "t": 490.2636076737,
        "r": 503.9911024533001,
        "b": 469.90818828573276
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0692",
      "reading_order": 745,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57968757799998,
        "t": 463.3835326857,
        "r": 503.9409040029011,
        "b": 443.0281132977328
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line A status bar, and the line A LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0693",
      "reading_order": 746,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57859197689996,
        "t": 436.5034576977,
        "r": 281.8457286159999,
        "b": 427.6080258157328
      },
      "content": "Press the [B] softkey to select line B."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0694",
      "reading_order": 747,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39840577189993,
        "t": 421.08337021570003,
        "r": 504.00773566999976,
        "b": 400.7279508277328
      },
      "content": "Verify  the  infuser  is  in  the PIGGYBACK delivery  mode.  If  necessary,  press [CHANGE MODE] to change the delivery mode."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0695",
      "reading_order": 748,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39840577189993,
        "t": 394.20329522770004,
        "r": 330.64370200990004,
        "b": 385.3078633457328
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 200 mL/hr and VTBI of 10 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0696",
      "reading_order": 749,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39840577189993,
        "t": 378.7234476857,
        "r": 503.95295561499944,
        "b": 358.4276887576328
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0697",
      "reading_order": 750,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39860497209996,
        "t": 351.8432730976,
        "r": 503.93213919410005,
        "b": 331.54751416953275
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line B status bar, and the line B LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0698",
      "reading_order": 751,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39860497209999,
        "t": 324.96309850949996,
        "r": 503.92317518509964,
        "b": 304.6673395814327
      },
      "content": "Verify the 'KVO' message flashes on the display and an audible alarm sounds when total delivery is complete on line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0699",
      "reading_order": 752,
      "section": "DELIVERY ACCURACY TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39970057319998,
        "t": 301.3597672113999,
        "r": 406.1633862328,
        "b": 288.38187418139995
      },
      "content": "Press [STOP] and verify the volume delivered is 20 mL ± 1 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0700",
      "reading_order": 753,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 266.71200999999996,
        "r": 221.26439752400003,
        "b": 237.80292588772727
      },
      "content": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0701",
      "reading_order": 754,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 230.40010000000007,
        "r": 484.0599272421006,
        "b": 213.40743492803279
      },
      "content": " Note: The nurse call test may be bypassed if the nurse call function is not used."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0702",
      "reading_order": 755,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.00036952810001,
        "t": 202.32308675000002,
        "r": 491.32187013319964,
        "b": 193.42765486803285
      },
      "content": "To perform the nurse call test, attach the nurse call test cable and proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0703",
      "reading_order": 756,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637830005,
        "t": 184.32325707790005,
        "r": 493.8747202963005,
        "b": 175.42782519593288
      },
      "content": "Set the primary delivery rate to 400 mL/hr, and the primary dose limit to 1 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0704",
      "reading_order": 757,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637830002,
        "t": 168.90316959589995,
        "r": 319.29486821550006,
        "b": 160.00773771393278
      },
      "content": "Connect a DMM to the nurse call test cable."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0705",
      "reading_order": 758,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637830002,
        "t": 153.42332205389994,
        "r": 307.3351870078002,
        "b": 144.52789017193277
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify pumping action."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0706",
      "reading_order": 759,
      "section": "5.2.16 NURSE CALL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637830002,
        "t": 138.00323457189995,
        "r": 504.0137116760011,
        "b": 116.84219732589997
      },
      "content": "After 'DOSE END' and 'KVO' appear on the display, observe a short circuit on the DMM (approximately 1 Ω on a scale of 0 to 100 Ω )."
    }
  ]
}